, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital | Alternative Investment Division", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "Key market indicators at a glance (2026Q2)"}, {"level": 1, "text": "1. Key News"}, {"level": 1, "text": "2. Market Trend"}, {"level": 1, "text": "3. Impact on Our Portfolio (GP stakes)"}, {"level": 1, "text": "4. Our Position: GPS V, benchmark and actions"}], "summary": "Conclusion: all three legs weakened together this quarter — deployment (-37.5% QoQ), exits (-46.3% QoQ) and fundraising (extreme concentration at the top) — and the through-line is liquidity: until distributions resume, ", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T03:03:09+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "private_equity-2026Q3-full-f114b9ec", "title": "2026Q3 美国私募股权季度报告", "sector": "private_equity", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "full", "language": "cn", "keywords": ["美国私募股权", "并购与杠杆收购", "中型市场", "GP少数股权"], "source_name": "Junson_PE_Report_2026Q3_CN_v2.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T09:24:19.042Z", "stats": {"blocks": 102, "images": 41, "tables": 9, "chars": 10943}, "exhibit_count": 50, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital 研究", "coverage": "美国私募股权／并购与杠杆收购／中型市场／GP少数股权", "publish_date": "2026年8月26日", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "市场综述"}, {"level": 1, "text": "交易活动"}, {"level": 2, "text": "交易金额与数量"}, {"level": 2, "text": "交易结构"}, {"level": 2, "text": "并购市场中的杠杆收购交易量"}, {"level": 2, "text": "中型市场"}, {"level": 2, "text": "交易量口径的嵌套关系——以及与私募信贷的连接点"}, {"level": 1, "text": "估值、业绩与融资"}, {"level": 2, "text": "入场倍数"}, {"level": 2, "text": "基金业绩：滚动期限内部收益率"}, {"level": 1, "text": "退出与流动性"}, {"level": 2, "text": "退出活动"}, {"level": 2, "text": "持有期与存量"}, {"level": 1, "text": "募资与待投资金"}, {"level": 2, "text": "募资"}, {"level": 2, "text": "待投资金与投放空间"}, {"level": 1, "text": "我们应当知道的事"}, {"level": 2, "text": "人工智能正在重定价私募股权最偏爱的行业"}, {"level": 2, "text": "规模是本轮募资周期的分界线"}, {"level": 2, "text": "私募股权市场如何传导至私募信贷市场"}, {"level": 2, "text": "私募股权市场如何传导至GP少数股权基金"}, {"level": 2, "text": "对Junson的启示"}, {"level": 1, "text": "基金更新"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Blue Owl GP Stakes V（GP少数股权策略）"}, {"level": 2, "text": "基金速览"}, {"level": 2, "text": "组合构成"}, {"level": 2, "text": "基金层面业绩"}, {"level": 1, "text": "竞争对手分析"}, {"level": 2, "text": "同业定位与联赛表"}, {"level": 2, "text": "直接对标（环比）：GPS V对HPC Fund I"}, {"level": 2, "text": "DPI基准：持仓在并购基金分配曲线上的位置"}, {"level": 2, "text": "相对动能与百分位轨迹"}, {"level": 2, "text": "附录——对标组与方法论"}], "summary": "2026年二季度对美国私募股权而言又是一个“假启动”季度：投放、退出与募资同步走弱。交易金额环比下降37.5%至1,773亿美元，退出金额近乎腰斩至1,026亿美元，年初至今募资1,596亿美元且绝大部分流向最大的管理人。估值标记暂且稳住，而10,670亿美元的待投资金按2025年投放节奏仅相当于约0.9年的投放空间——这种压力指向继续投放，而非投资纪律。贯穿全局的主线正如PitchBook所言是流动性：在分配真正恢复之前，募资与新投放", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T03:18:23+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-summary-54e2fa04", "title": "2026Q3 AI 基础设施研究报告摘要", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "summary", "language": "cn", "keywords": ["AI 基础设施产业链", "数据中心", "基建私募信贷", "ABF", "直接贷款", "完整报告日期: 2026年10月5日"], "source_name": "AI_Infrastructure_2026Q3_Summary_中文版.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T09:20:23.777Z", "stats": {"blocks": 22, "images": 0, "tables": 4, "chars": 4630}, "exhibit_count": 4, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital | Alternative Investment Division", "coverage": "AI 基础设施产业链 / 数据中心 / 基建私募信贷 / ABF / 直接贷款    |    完整报告日期: 2026年10月5日", "toc": [], "summary": "上游供应 AI 服务器 BOM 价值占比最高的五类零部件: GPU、HBM、先进封装 (CoWoS)、PCB/载板、光模块。中游有两条生产线——零部件装成整机柜、楼壳变成带电机房——两条线背后是发电环节, 数据中心越来越多直接采购电力 (「电力是新的土地」)。下游有内部结构: colo 是房东层 (Equinix、Digital Realty、Vantage、GDS); 超大规模云厂商横跨两层——自建数据中心, 同时是 colo 最大租", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T09:39:03+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-summary-8d7b5ef2", "title": "2026Q3 AI Infrastructure Opportunities Mapping Summary", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "summary", "language": "en", "keywords": ["AI infrastructure value chain", "data centers", "infrastructure debt", "ABF", "direct lending", "Full report dated 5 Oct 2026"], "source_name": "AI_Infrastructure_2026Q3_Summary_EN.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T09:20:01.927Z", "stats": {"blocks": 22, "images": 0, "tables": 4, "chars": 10430}, "exhibit_count": 4, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital | Alternative Investment Division", "coverage": "AI infrastructure value chain / data centers / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending    |    Full report dated 5 Oct 2026", "toc": [], "summary": "Upstream supplies the five components carrying the bulk of AI server BOM value: GPU, HBM, advanced packaging (CoWoS), PCB/substrate, optical modules. Midstream runs two production lines — components into complete racks, ", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T09:39:03+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-full-2bd31bc5", "title": "2026Q3 AI 基础设施投资机会全景", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "full", "language": "cn", "keywords": ["AI 基础设施产业链", "数据中心", "infrastructure debt", "ABF", "direct lending"], "source_name": "Junson_AI_Infrastructure_Report_2026Q3_CN_v3.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T08:53:35.888Z", "stats": {"blocks": 75, "images": 3, "tables": 11, "chars": 15413}, "exhibit_count": 14, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital Research", "coverage": "AI 基础设施产业链 / 数据中心 / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending", "publish_date": "2026 年 10 月 5 日", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "产业链全景"}, {"level": 2, "text": "三层结构：从芯片到终端用户"}, {"level": 2, "text": "AI 价值链 vs 数据中心产业链"}, {"level": 1, "text": "供给瓶颈"}, {"level": 2, "text": "瓶颈集中在上中游；下游延期是传导性的"}, {"level": 2, "text": "“不敢”与“不能”：两大最深短缺为何是结构性的"}, {"level": 1, "text": "股还是债？机会定位图"}, {"level": 2, "text": "两个问题决定工具"}, {"level": 2, "text": "横轴怎么读：现金流被合同锁定的程度"}, {"level": 2, "text": "纵轴怎么读：违约时能拿走什么"}, {"level": 2, "text": "收益率锚点"}, {"level": 1, "text": "资本市场深度"}, {"level": 2, "text": "逐行解读"}, {"level": 1, "text": "上游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "名词卡：fab、fabless、foundry 与 IDM"}, {"level": 2, "text": "上游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "中游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "中游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "下游：分板块明细"}, {"level": 2, "text": "下游四个结论"}, {"level": 1, "text": "下行风险"}, {"level": 2, "text": "贯穿全链的五大风险"}, {"level": 2, "text": "分板块下行风险"}, {"level": 1, "text": "基金评估"}, {"level": 2, "text": "可投基金宇宙：三种类型"}, {"level": 2, "text": "五个问题，锚定本报告"}, {"level": 2, "text": "分类型尽调重点"}], "summary": "我们把数据中心产业链分为三层。上游供应半导体与核心零部件：GPU 裸片与 HBM 存储通过 TSMC 的 CoWoS 工艺封装成一颗器件；封装好的芯片再焊到载板 / PCB（芯片的“座位”）上；光模块完全不在封装之内，而是插在交换机上连接机柜。上游还包括 CPU、网络与电源半导体，以及晶圆厂背后的设备与材料层；本文聚焦上述五个零部件，因为它们占 AI 服务器 BOM 价值的大头，也是当前供给瓶颈与定价权所在。中游把零部件变成整机、把楼变", "updated_at": "2026-11-03T08:55:31+00:00", "source_file": "source.docx"}, {"id": "infrastructure-2026Q3-full-3c69f100", "title": "2026Q3 AI Infrastructure Opportunities Mapping", "sector": "infrastructure", "year": 2026, "quarter": 3, "period": "3Q2026", "period_key": 20263, "nature": "full", "language": "en", "keywords": ["AI infrastructure value chain", "data centers", "infrastructure debt", "ABF", "direct lending"], "source_name": "Junson_AI_Infrastructure_Report_2026Q3_EN_v3.docx", "source_ext": ".docx", "uploaded_at": "2026-11-03T08:52:53.503Z", "stats": {"blocks": 75, "images": 3, "tables": 11, "chars": 40659}, "exhibit_count": 14, "masthead": "JUNSON Capital Research", "coverage": "AI infrastructure value chain / data centers / infrastructure debt / ABF / direct lending", "publish_date": "5 Oct, 2026", "toc": [{"level": 1, "text": "Value Chain"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Three layers: from chips to the end-user"}, {"level": 2, "text": "The AI value chain vs the data center value chain"}, {"level": 1, "text": "Supply Bottlenecks"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Constraints sit upstream and midstream; downstream delays are transmitted"}, {"level": 2, "text": "Won't vs can't: why the two deepest shortages are structural"}, {"level": 1, "tex